{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":463536,"name":"Yu Ishikawa","username":"yu-iskw","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/y/cab0a1/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-08-12T01:49:39.410Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eHi Cursor team,\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eI am not sure if this is the right place to ask questions about  the privacy policy and term of use of Grok Bot. But I assume some other Cursor users might want to know it too.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWe can currently use Grok Bot beta with Cursor Ultra for individuals and Team Premium.  According to my research, the privacy policy and the term of use of Grok Bot follow those of xAI not Cursor.  So, collected data in Grok Bot can be used for product improvement.  My question is that Grok Bot doesn’t provide something like the privacy mode of Cursor?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://x.ai/legal/privacy-policy\" class=\"onebox\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003ehttps://x.ai/legal/privacy-policy\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://x.ai/legal/terms-of-service-enterprise\" class=\"onebox\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003ehttps://x.ai/legal/terms-of-service-enterprise\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://x.ai/legal/terms-of-service\" class=\"onebox\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003ehttps://x.ai/legal/terms-of-service\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":1,"post_type":1,"posts_count":4,"updated_at":"2026-08-12T01:49:48.602Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":287,"reads":11,"readers_count":10,"score":1437.2,"yours":false,"topic_id":168075,"topic_slug":"privacy-and-term-of-use-of-grok-bot-with-cursor-account","display_username":"Yu Ishikawa","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":3,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"link_counts":[{"url":"https://x.ai/legal/privacy-policy","internal":false,"reflection":false,"clicks":4},{"url":"https://x.ai/legal/terms-of-service","internal":false,"reflection":false,"clicks":1},{"url":"https://x.ai/legal/terms-of-service-enterprise","internal":false,"reflection":false,"clicks":1}],"read":true,"user_title":"","bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":642,"hidden":false,"trust_level":2,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/privacy-and-term-of-use-of-grok-bot-with-cursor-account/168075/1","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null,"can_vote":false},{"id":463873,"name":"Mohit","username":"mohitjain","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/mohitjain/{size}/100229_2.png","created_at":"2026-08-12T11:08:52.809Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eHey \u003ca class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/yu-iskw\"\u003e@yu-iskw\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe short version: when you use Grok Bot through your Cursor account (Ultra or Team Premium), the data handling follows your Cursor account and privacy settings, not xAI’s general privacy policy. The generic x.ai/legal pages you linked cover xAI’s own products, which is why they don’t say anything Cursor-specific.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eA few specifics:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCursor Privacy Mode does apply to Grok Bot. With Privacy Mode on, your Grok Bot data isn’t used for training by Cursor or any model provider (including xAI). For teams, the team’s privacy setting governs all members.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTraining opt-out follows your Cursor privacy settings, the same controls you already use across the rest of Cursor.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOne exception: Grok Bot needs data storage to run, so Legacy Privacy Mode (no storage) blocks Grok Bot entirely. If you’re on Legacy Privacy Mode, you’ll see a prompt about that.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Grok Bot docs cover this here: \u003ca href=\"https://docs.x.ai/grok-bot/approvals-security-and-privacy\"\u003eApprovals, security, and privacy\u003c/a\u003e, and the contractual details live in the \u003ca href=\"https://cursor.com/privacy\"\u003eCursor Privacy Policy\u003c/a\u003e and \u003ca href=\"https://cursor.com/security\"\u003esecurity page\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":6,"post_type":1,"posts_count":4,"updated_at":"2026-08-12T11:08:52.809Z","reply_count":2,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":4,"reads":12,"readers_count":11,"score":62.4,"yours":false,"topic_id":168075,"topic_slug":"privacy-and-term-of-use-of-grok-bot-with-cursor-account","display_username":"Mohit","primary_group_name":"CursorStaff","flair_name":"CursorStaff","flair_url":"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/a/d/ad08adc640929ae1e98be69dab1ad0844cee99a0.png","flair_bg_color":"","flair_color":"","flair_group_id":42,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"link_counts":[{"url":"https://docs.x.ai/grok-bot/approvals-security-and-privacy","internal":false,"reflection":false,"title":"Approvals, security, and privacy | SpaceXAI Docs","clicks":19},{"url":"https://cursor.com/privacy","internal":false,"reflection":false,"title":"Cursor · Privacy Policy","clicks":9},{"url":"https://cursor.com/security","internal":false,"reflection":false,"title":"Cursor · Security","clicks":7}],"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[{"id":2,"count":2}],"moderator":true,"admin":true,"staff":true,"user_id":103596,"hidden":false,"trust_level":4,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/privacy-and-term-of-use-of-grok-bot-with-cursor-account/168075/6","reactions":[{"id":"heart","type":"emoji","count":2}],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":2,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null},{"id":466516,"name":"Yu Ishikawa","username":"yu-iskw","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/y/cab0a1/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-08-16T10:06:43.368Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003e\u003ca class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/mohitjain\"\u003e@mohitjain\u003c/a\u003e Thank you for answering my question and the valuable information. Now, it is clear for me.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":7,"post_type":1,"posts_count":4,"updated_at":"2026-08-16T10:06:43.368Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":6,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":10,"reads":8,"readers_count":7,"score":51.6,"yours":false,"topic_id":168075,"topic_slug":"privacy-and-term-of-use-of-grok-bot-with-cursor-account","display_username":"Yu Ishikawa","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":"","reply_to_user":{"id":103596,"username":"mohitjain","name":"Mohit","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/mohitjain/{size}/100229_2.png"},"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":642,"hidden":false,"trust_level":2,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/privacy-and-term-of-use-of-grok-bot-with-cursor-account/168075/7","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"